    "media:imagetext": "FLY-EASTERN AIR LINES\nFEBRUARY—1958\nSun\nMon Tue Wed Thu\nFri\nSat\nSun\nMARCH-1958\nMon Tue Wed Thu\nFri\n4\n5\n10\n12\n13\n16\n17\n18\n19\n20\n7\n14\n21\n23-24\n25 26 27 28\n8\n15\n22\n16\n23\n30\n10\n17\n24\n31\n4\n5\n6\n7\n12\n13\n14\n18.19\n20\n21\nSat\n1\n8\n15\n22\n25\n26 27 28 29\nBring the Family along\non\nEASTERN'S\n½ FARE\nFAMILY PLAN\nPurchase of one full-fare Eastern Air\nLines ticket by one parent entitles\nother parent and all children ages 2\nthrough 21 to ride ½-Fare on any\nTuesday, Wednesday or Thursday.\nNo round trip discount except for\nchildren,\nages 2 through 11. This\nplan does not apply on Aircoaches.\nOn all flights, every day of the week, one child under 2 carried FREE.••\nchildren 2 and over, but under 12, travel ½ fare.\nFOR RESERVATIONS AND INFORMATION CALL\nMUrray Hill 8-8000 in New York\nMitchell 3-5600 in New Jersey\nTicket Offices:\nEAST SIDE AIRLINES TERMINAL\nIst Ave. at 37th - 38th Streets, N. Y. C.\nWEST SIDE AIRLINES TERMINAL\n10th Ave. at 42nd Street, N. Y. C.\nAIRLINES BUILDING\nPark Ave. \u0026 42nd Street, N. Y. C.\nEASTERN AIR LINES BUILDING\n16 Rockefeller Plaza, N. Y. C.\n1407 Broadway, N. Y. C.\nLobby of 100 Broadway, N. Y. C.\n200 Livingston St., Brooklyn, N. Y.\n35 Mamaroneck Ave., White Plains, N. Y.\n(Call WHite Plains 6-1166)\nLaGUARDIA AIRPORT\nNEW YORK INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT\n(Idlewild)\n11 Commerce St., Newark, N. J.\nNEWARK AIRPORT",
